 "costNote": "shorts_studio_create cost replies, recorded from production 2026-09-20 against the real connected account with get_cost:true and nothing else (the free, non-submitting form; no session was created). Verbatim, exactly as the tool returned them. The account prices 3 credits per second of source: for a whole number of seconds `credits` and `credits_exact` agree, and for a fractional duration \u2014 which is what a measured stored duration is \u2014 `credits` is `credits_exact` truncated to an integer. The 19 September capture recorded no create call at all, which is why the parser was written assuming the two are always equal.",
